<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1757660923"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:41.600"><div begin="14.001" end="37.096" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="14.001" end="19.149" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.001" end="16.369">你对我坦诚自</span><span begin="16.369" end="17.277">己</span><span begin="17.277" end="18.107">的脆</span><span begin="18.107" end="19.149">弱</span></p><p begin="20.457" end="24.459" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="20.457" end="22.843">我陪你抚平伤</span><span begin="22.843" end="24.459">痛</span></p><p begin="26.861" end="32.093" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.861" end="28.454">打包那些</span><span begin="28.454" end="29.222">没完</span><span begin="29.222" end="30.080">成</span><span begin="30.080" end="30.907">的承</span><span begin="30.907" end="32.093">诺</span></p><p begin="33.195" end="37.096" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.195" end="33.657">准备</span><span begin="33.657" end="34.137">好</span><span begin="34.137" end="35.615">一个人生</span><span begin="35.615" end="37.096">活</span></p></div><div begin="38.051" end="1:03.075" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="38.051" end="44.915" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.051" end="40.822">那些没看过的风</span><span begin="40.822" end="41.810">景</span> <span begin="42.356" end="43.761">有那麼</span><span begin="43.761" end="44.915">多</span></p><p begin="46.055" end="49.729" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.055" end="48.427">更爱看你的笑</span><span begin="48.427" end="49.729">容</span></p><p begin="50.859" end="58.047" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.859" end="53.640">把所有的生日愿</span><span begin="53.640" end="54.601">望</span> <span begin="55.010" end="55.306">交</span><span begin="55.306" end="56.360">由你的</span><span begin="56.360" end="58.047">手</span></p><p begin="58.887" end="1:03.075" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.887" end="1:01.276">等蜡烛吹熄之</span><span begin="1:01.276" end="1:03.075">后</span></p></div><div begin="1:04.065" end="1:30.049" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:04.065" end="1:09.804" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.065" end="1:04.896">我只希望</span><span begin="1:04.896" end="1:05.345">和</span><span begin="1:05.345" end="1:05.894">你淋</span><span begin="1:05.894" end="1:06.516">的</span><span begin="1:06.516" end="1:06.842">那</span><span begin="1:06.842" end="1:07.455">场大</span><span begin="1:07.455" end="1:08.156">雨</span> <span begin="1:08.156" end="1:08.489">不</span><span begin="1:08.489" end="1:08.787">会</span><span begin="1:08.787" end="1:09.804">停</span></p><p begin="1:10.487" end="1:15.975" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.487" end="1:11.332">一起欢笑</span><span begin="1:11.332" end="1:11.637">到</span><span begin="1:11.637" end="1:11.971">深</span><span begin="1:11.971" end="1:12.319">夜</span> <span begin="1:12.319" end="1:12.963">忘</span><span begin="1:12.963" end="1:13.483">记叫</span><span begin="1:13.483" end="1:14.543">醒黎</span><span begin="1:14.543" end="1:15.975">明</span></p><p begin="1:16.877" end="1:23.337" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.877" end="1:17.692">我只希望</span><span begin="1:17.692" end="1:18.125">你</span><span begin="1:18.125" end="1:18.622">的冒</span><span begin="1:18.622" end="1:19.266">险</span><span begin="1:19.266" end="1:19.700">你</span><span begin="1:19.700" end="1:19.912">的</span><span begin="1:19.912" end="1:20.523">寻</span><span begin="1:20.523" end="1:20.889">觅</span> <span begin="1:20.889" end="1:21.290">分</span><span begin="1:21.290" end="1:21.576">秒</span><span begin="1:21.576" end="1:22.146">都</span><span begin="1:22.146" end="1:22.465">美</span><span begin="1:22.465" end="1:23.337">丽</span></p><p begin="1:23.900" end="1:30.049" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:23.900" end="1:24.197">用</span><span begin="1:24.197" end="1:25.656">不停机的</span><span begin="1:25.656" end="1:26.278">长</span><span begin="1:26.278" end="1:27.075">镜</span> <span begin="1:27.248" end="1:28.474">祝福着</span><span begin="1:28.474" end="1:30.049">你</span></p></div><div begin="1:34.070" end="1:57.307" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:34.070" end="1:39.187" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.070" end="1:36.374">你想开启从未</span><span begin="1:36.374" end="1:37.196">实</span><span begin="1:37.196" end="1:38.095">现的</span><span begin="1:38.095" end="1:39.187">梦</span></p><p begin="1:40.405" end="1:44.091" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:40.405" end="1:42.879">找回遗忘的自</span><span begin="1:42.879" end="1:44.091">由</span></p><p begin="1:46.859" end="1:52.091" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:46.859" end="1:49.261">带自己走出心</span><span begin="1:49.261" end="1:50.114">中</span><span begin="1:50.114" end="1:50.935">的荒</span><span begin="1:50.935" end="1:52.091">漠</span></p><p begin="1:53.284" end="1:57.307" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:53.284" end="1:53.759">一路</span><span begin="1:53.759" end="1:55.733">到世界的尽</span><span begin="1:55.733" end="1:57.307">头</span></p></div><div begin="1:58.014" end="2:23.091" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="1:58.014" end="2:04.908" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:58.014" end="2:00.867">那些没看过的风</span><span begin="2:00.867" end="2:01.976">景</span> <span begin="2:02.496" end="2:03.719">有那麼</span><span begin="2:03.719" end="2:04.908">多</span></p><p begin="2:06.074" end="2:09.728" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:06.074" end="2:08.499">更爱看你的笑</span><span begin="2:08.499" end="2:09.728">容</span></p><p begin="2:10.861" end="2:18.029" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:10.861" end="2:13.694">把所有的生日愿</span><span begin="2:13.694" end="2:14.718">望</span> <span begin="2:15.028" end="2:15.342">交</span><span begin="2:15.342" end="2:16.396">由你的</span><span begin="2:16.396" end="2:18.029">手</span></p><p begin="2:18.863" end="2:23.091" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:18.863" end="2:21.283">等蜡烛吹熄之</span><span begin="2:21.283" end="2:23.091">后</span></p></div><div begin="2:24.062" end="2:49.672" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="2:24.062" end="2:29.771" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:24.062" end="2:24.928">我只希望</span><span begin="2:24.928" end="2:25.312">和</span><span begin="2:25.312" end="2:25.890">你淋</span><span begin="2:25.890" end="2:26.512">的</span><span begin="2:26.512" end="2:26.867">那</span><span begin="2:26.867" end="2:27.508">场大</span><span begin="2:27.508" end="2:28.166">雨</span> <span begin="2:28.166" end="2:28.542">不</span><span begin="2:28.542" end="2:28.790">会</span><span begin="2:28.790" end="2:29.771">停</span></p><p begin="2:30.478" end="2:35.966" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:30.478" end="2:31.323">一起欢笑</span><span begin="2:31.323" end="2:31.683">到</span><span begin="2:31.683" end="2:31.976">深</span><span begin="2:31.976" end="2:32.331">夜</span> <span begin="2:32.331" end="2:32.926">忘</span><span begin="2:32.926" end="2:33.522">记叫</span><span begin="2:33.522" end="2:34.569">醒黎</span><span begin="2:34.569" end="2:35.966">明</span></p><p begin="2:36.858" end="2:43.318" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:36.858" end="2:37.738">我只希望</span><span begin="2:37.738" end="2:38.130">你</span><span begin="2:38.130" end="2:38.652">的冒</span><span begin="2:38.652" end="2:39.280">险</span><span begin="2:39.280" end="2:39.665">你</span><span begin="2:39.665" end="2:39.926">的</span><span begin="2:39.926" end="2:40.520">寻</span><span begin="2:40.520" end="2:40.911">觅</span> <span begin="2:40.911" end="2:41.320">分</span><span begin="2:41.320" end="2:41.589">秒</span><span begin="2:41.589" end="2:42.160">都</span><span begin="2:42.160" end="2:42.487">美</span><span begin="2:42.487" end="2:43.318">丽</span></p><p begin="2:43.884" end="2:49.672" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:43.884" end="2:44.135">用</span><span begin="2:44.135" end="2:45.679">不停机的</span><span begin="2:45.679" end="2:46.363">长</span><span begin="2:46.363" end="2:47.059">镜</span> <span begin="2:47.